  "level_notes": {
    "1": "No single defining document; the classic primary texts (Frege, Hilbert-Ackermann, Gödel, Gentzen, Church) are mostly paywalled or in German. SEP and open textbooks give the standard modern definition.",
    "0": "Mechanised syntax/semantics (Lean mathlib model theory, Isabelle/FOL, Coq) and automated provers (Vampire, E)."
  },
